@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<HeadContent>
    <style>
        :root {
            text-align: center;
        }

        p {
            padding: 20px 0 10px 0;
        }

        .book {
            margin: 10px;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
        }

        .grid img {
            display: block;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 25px
        }
    </style>
</HeadContent>
<h1>Exercise App</h1>
<img class="book" src="images/exerciseBook_edit.jpg" alt="A book on the history of physical education." />
<p>
    We are so excited that you have chosen to visit this website.
    This site shows you some of the basic exercises given throughout history.
    It was created by a team in a classroom and they thought to share it specifically with you.
    Here are some of the exercises we have in store for you.
</p>
<div class="grid">
    <img src="images/pushups.png" alt="push-ups"/>
    <img src="images/situps_edit.jpg" alt="sit-ups" />
    <img src="images/squats.jpg" alt="squats"/>
    <img src="images/pullups_edit.png" alt="pull-ups"/>
    <img src="images/bicepCurls_edit.jpg" alt="bicep curls" />
    <img src="images/lunges_edit.jpg" alt="lunges"/>
</div>
<p>
    So thank you and we hope you enjoy our website which we worked so hard to create.
</p>